{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1f0b6f2-6d2f-4f6e-9c8f-2f8f3d9b6a10",
    "name": "GlobInn Hotel Module",
    "description": "REST API documentation for the GlobInn Hotel module (NestJS + PostgreSQL + Sequelize).\n\n### Endpoints\n| Method | Path | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| POST | `{{baseUrl}}/hotels` | Create a hotel with optional images |\n| GET | `{{baseUrl}}/hotels/autocomplete?q=` | Prefix autocomplete over active hotels (max 10, no images) |\n| GET | `{{baseUrl}}/hotels/:id` | Hotel details including images ordered by sortOrder |\n\n### Setup\n1. `npm install`\n2. create the database (`createdb globinn_hotels`)\n3. `npm run migration:run`\n4. `npm run seed`\n5. `npm run start:dev`\n\n### Error format\nAll errors use the standard NestJS body, for example:\n```json\n{ \"statusCode\": 400, \"message\": [\"name should not be empty\"], \"error\": \"Bad Request\" }\n```\nSQL queries, database credentials and stack traces are never exposed.\n\n### Status codes\n| Status | When |\n|---|---|\n| 200 | Successful autocomplete / hotel details |\n| 201 | Hotel created |\n| 400 | Request validation failed, query shorter than 2 characters, more than one primary image, non numeric id |\n| 404 | Hotel not found |\n| 409 | Duplicate image url for the same hotel |\n| 500 | Unexpected error |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL of the running API (a Render URL can be used instead)"
    },
    {
      "key": "hotelId",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Hotel id used by the details request; set this manually"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Create Hotel",
      "description": "Creates a hotel and, optionally, its images inside a single transaction. The hotel is always created as active.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create hotel with multiple images",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/hotels",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "hotels"
              ]
            },
            "description": "**POST /hotels**\n\nCreates a hotel and its images inside one database transaction.\n\n**Body parameters**\n| Field | Type | Required | Rules |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| name | string | yes | 1-255 characters |\n| description | string | no | max 2000 characters |\n| address | string | yes | 1-255 characters |\n| city | string | yes | 1-120 characters |\n| countryCode | string | yes | valid ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 code (stored uppercase) |\n| latitude | number | yes | -90 to 90 |\n| longitude | number | yes | -180 to 180 |\n| starRating | integer | yes | 1 to 5 |\n| images | array | no | see below |\n| images[].url | string | yes | valid HTTP/HTTPS url, unique per hotel |\n| images[].isPrimary | boolean | no | at most one primary image |\n| images[].sortOrder | integer | no | >= 0, defaults to the array position |\n\n**Business rules**\n- the hotel is created with `isActive: true`\n- when no image is marked primary, the first image becomes primary\n- more than one primary image returns 400\n- duplicate image urls for the same hotel return 409\n- properties outside the contract return 400\n\n**Responses:** 201 Created, 400 Bad Request, 409 Conflict",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"The Grand Hotel\",\n  \"description\": \"Luxury hotel in Delhi\",\n  \"address\": \"MG Road\",\n  \"city\": \"Delhi\",\n  \"countryCode\": \"IN\",\n  \"latitude\": 28.6139,\n  \"longitude\": 77.209,\n  \"starRating\": 5,\n  \"images\": [\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/hotel-1.jpg\",\n      \"isPrimary\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://example.com/hotel-2.jpg\",\n      \"isPrimary\": false\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
